j+\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}}\\,k$ at $t=2.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find ${f}^{′}(t)$ by differentiating each component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t{e}^{t})\\,i-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}})k \\\\  & =(t+1){e}^{t}\\,i-6t\\,j-\\frac{6}{{t}^{3}}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, to compute ${f}^{′}(2)$ we substitute $t=2$ into the expression for ${f}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(2) & =(2+1){e}^{2}\\,i-6(2)\\,j-\\frac{6}{{2}^{3}}\\,k \\\\  & =3{e}^{2}\\,i-12\\,j-\\frac{3}{4}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130405/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b31f2bdc-c267-5fc7-bd0f-283777ee4fee"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130405"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-347628/field-1/e092f84738eb634552c1f9b268d42b7b279749267a96c47f29ea5ebf78e3b2f6" :answer/id #uuid "67e714c1-d19a-50ee-841f-16500ad16c52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\cos(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-347628/field-1/362bede28713d3197ad64f218eaeca6d1a474cd0ab03423f4e1040470371e970" :answer/id #uuid "ad315727-eb7f-5354-bbab-439e06f75dd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sin(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-347628/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0af204b7-e80e-517b-b400-b842c5391472" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-347628/field-1/e092f84738eb634552c1f9b268d42b7b279749267a96c47f29ea5ebf78e3b2f6" :answer-field/choices ["q-347628/field-1/e092f84738eb634552c1f9b268d42b7b279749267a96c47f29ea5ebf78e3b2f6" "q-347628/field-1/362bede28713d3197ad64f218eaeca6d1a474cd0ab03423f4e1040470371e970"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-347628/field-2/8ea445c44903d3856132beba39cf34c1891f46bd59a09efc52ecfb87e61f683a" :answer/id #uuid "d34acfc3-184b-5